# --- Root Level .gitignore for Spring Boot Monorepo ---

# Ignore build outputs in any subfolder
**/target/
**/build/
**/out/

# Ignore Maven Wrapper files across all projects
**/.mvn/
**/mvnw
**/mvnw.cmd
**/maven-wrapper.jar

# Keep target folders that are actually source code (rare Spring Boot edge case)
!**/src/main/**/target/
!**/src/test/**/target/

# Help files
HELP.md

### STS (Spring Tool Suite) ###
**/.apt_generated
**/.classpath
**/.factorypath
**/.project
**/.settings/
**/.springBeans
**/.sts4-cache

### IntelliJ IDEA ###
**/.idea/
**/*.iws
**/*.iml
**/*.ipr

### VS Code ###
**/.vscode/

### Operating System files ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Ignore local database data
**/db_volumes/